SUMMARY:Petit Planet Official Release Preview Program
DESCRIPTION:miHoYo will host the Petit Planet Official Release Preview Program on November 1 at 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature members of the development team and special guests introducing the game content of Petit Planet\, including nurturing your own planet and interacting with unique neighbors as you turn the “first page” of your new cosmic life. Information on upcoming events and campaigns will also be announced.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/petit-planet-official-release-preview-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Petit-Planet_11-01-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
