DESCRIPTION:No More Robots will host the No More Robots 9th Anniversary Showcase on November 3 at 10:00 a.m. PT / 1:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe showcase will feature game announcements\, demos\, updates\, and more.
