SUMMARY:Wuthering Waves Version 3.8 Preview Special Broadcast
DESCRIPTION:Kuro Games will host the Wuthering Waves Version 3.8 Preview Special Broadcast on November 6 at 3:00 a.m. PT / 6:00 a.m. ET / 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean).
