SUMMARY:PlayStation Partner Awards 2026 Japan Asia
DESCRIPTION:Sony Interactive Entertainment Japan Asia will host PlayStation Partner Awards 2026 Japan Asia on December 3. \nPlayStation Partner Awards 2026 Japan Asia recognizes the PlayStation versions of hit titles sold across the Japan and Asia regions. \nThe award categories are as follows: \nGrand Award \nAwarded to the top three titles developed in the Japan / Asian regions with highest worldwide sales between October 1\, 2025 and September 30\, 2026. \nPartner Award \nAwarded to titles developed in the Japan / Asia region with top-ranked worldwide sales between October 1\, 2025 and September 30\, 2026\, with particularly noteworthy activity results. \nAccessibility Award \nAwarded to titles with outstanding accessibility features. \nOngoing Game Award \nAwarded to titles that continue to entertain players post-launch via ongoing updates and events. \nIndependent Creators’ Award \nAwarded to outstanding independent games from the Japan / Asia regions titles selected by PlayStation players. \nUsers can vote from the following titles: \nCoffee Talk Tokyo (Chorus Worldwide)inKONBINI: One Store. Many Stories. (Beep Japan)Lost Eidolons: Veil of the Witch (Kakao Games)Lumines Arise (Enhance Games)Mistfall Hunter (Skystone Games)Never Grave: The Witch and The Curse (Pocketpair)STARBITES (Nippon Ichi Software)Starward (Shengtian Games)Village in the Shade (Nippon Ichi Software)\nPlayStation 5 Pro Integration Award \nAwarded to games that fully utilize PlayStation 5 Pro’s capabilities. \nPlayers’ Choice Award \nAwarded to the top titles in the Japan / Asia regions selected by PlayStation players. The title candidates are directly taken from the top 30 titles released between October 1\, 2025 and September 30\, 2026\, ranked by total playtime in the region during the same period. \nUsers can vote from the following titles: \n007 First Light (IO Interactive)ARC Raiders (Nexon / Embark Studios)Arknights: Endfield (GRYPHLINE)Assassin’s Creed Black Flag Resynced (Ubisoft)Battlefield 6 (Electronic Arts)Beast of Reincarnation (Fictions)Code Vein II (Bandai Namco Entertainment)Crimson Desert (Pearl Abyss)Digimon Story: Time Stranger (Bandai Namco Entertainment)Dragon Quest I & II HD-2D Remake (Square Enix)Dragon Quest VII Reimagined (Square Enix)Onimusha: Way of the Sword (Capcom)Inazuma Eleven: Victory Road (LEVEL-5)Monster Hunter Stories 3: Twisted Reflection (Capcom)Neverness to Everness (Perfect World Games)Nioh 3 (Koei Tecmo Games)Octopath Traveler 0 (Square Enix)Powerful Pro Baseball 2026-2027 (Konami Digital Entertainment)PRAGMATA (Capcom)PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS (KRAFTON)Resident Evil Requiem (CAPCOM)Satisfactory (Coffee Stain Publishing)SEGA Football Club Champions 2026 (SEGA)Starfield (Bethesda Softworks)Starward (Shengtian Games)The Seven Deadly Sins: Origin (Netmarble)Tokyo Xtreme Racer (Genki)Where Winds Meet (NetEase Games)Yakuza 0 Director’s Cut (SEGA)Yakuza Kiwami 3 & Dark Ties (SEGA)\nVote Now \nVoting is available via the following links: \nHong KongIndonesiaJapanMalaysiaThailandSingaporeSouth Korea\nVoting will close on November 6 at 23:59 JST.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/playstation-partner-awards-2026-japan-asia
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_PlayStation-Partner-Awards-2026_12-03-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
